    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71012" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νομ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			(<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νομή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.3b
				</span></i>
			) <i>like a spreading ulcer,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Aphr.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					1.92
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.860
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σηπεδών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					10.702
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>full of shreds</i> as from such sores, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαχωρήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					14.754
				</span></i>
			.</div>
